REMARK 300 EPISTEMIC PROVENANCE: COMPOSITE ACTIVE-SITE EXCERPT OF SOLVED CRYSTAL STRUCTURES
REMARK 300  This file is a composite active-site excerpt of selected chain fragments from
REMARK 300  three separate source structures (2V4J, 3M0J, 1J58); it is NOT one single
REMARK 300  crystallographic co-assembly of all three proteins.
REMARK 300  To inspect the complete original crystallographic assemblies independently:
REMARK 300    PyMOL    : fetch 2v4j 3m0j 1j58, async=0
REMARK 300    ChimeraX : open 2v4j 3m0j 1j58
REMARK 300 CHAIN A: DsrB dissimilatory sulfite reductase (PDB 2V4J, UniProt P45575)
REMARK 300          Motif C-X(2)-C-X(3)-C (Cys261-Gly262-Asn263-Cys264-Tyr265-Thr266-Met267-Cys268 = CGNCYTMC)
REMARK 300          Coordinating [Fe4S4] cluster (FS4 501) and siroheme Fe (SRM 502)
REMARK 300 CHAIN B: OahA oxaloacetate acetylhydrolase (PDB 3M0J, 1.55 A, An10g00820)
REMARK 300          Motif M-G-F-R-I-M-I-F-S-F-A (Met18..Ala28) with Mg2+ (MG 301) and oxalate (OXA 302)
REMARK 300 CHAIN C: OxdC bicupin oxalate decarboxylase (PDB 1J58, 1.75 A, BSU_33240)
REMARK 300          Motif H-X-H-X(3)-E (His95, His97, Glu101) coordinating Mn2+ (MN 401) and oxalate (OXL 402)
REMARK 300 LIMITATION: Visual inspection in PyMOL/ChimeraX verifies active-site geometry and
REMARK 300             contacts; it is NOT a standalone certificate of catalytic kinetics.
